 is not a role that slipped away from him late.\n\nOur number is 262, about 20 points better than what backs drafted around his ADP of 1.4 have returned with busts and injuries pooled in. Most outcomes land between 218 and 307, and the low tail comes from seasons cut short by injury, not decline, given two clean 17-game years and the same coach and play caller back in Detroit. We would draft him at 1.4 without blinking. He is our RB1, and the only reason to hesitate is if you would rather chase whoever else falls to you there.","pulls":[{"figure":"262","caption":"projected PPR points"},{"figure":"1.4","caption":"his ADP in PPR drafts"}]},"season":{"season":2026,"format":"ppr-12","weeks":18,"through":5,"games":5,"pointsPerGame":30.7,"totals":{"pass_attempts":0.0,"completions":0.0,"passing_yards":0.0,"passing_touchdowns":0.0,"interceptions":0.0,"carries":105.0,"rushing_yards":504.0,"rushing_touchdowns":7.0,"targets":34.0,"receptions":27.0,"receiving_yards":243.0,"receiving_touchdowns":2.0,"fumbles_lost":1.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"defensive_interceptions":0.0,"defensive_touchdowns":0.0,"snapShare":0.7674418604651163,"points":153.7},"log":[{"pass_attempts":0.0,"completions":0.0,"passing_yards":0.0,"passing_touchdowns":0.0,"interceptions":0.0,"carries":29.0,"rushing_yards":156.0,"rushing_touchdowns":2.0,"targets":5.0,"receptions":5.0,"receiving_yards":30.0,"receiving_touchdowns":0.0,"fumbles_lost":1.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"defensive_interceptions":0.0,"defensive_touchdowns":0.0,"snapShare":0.7402597402597403,"points":33.6,"week":1,"opponent":"NO","home":true,"status":"played"},{"pass_attempts":0.0,"completions":0.0,"passing_yards":0.0,"passing_touchdowns":0.0,"interceptions":0.0,"carries":16.0,"rushing_yards":52.0,"rushing_touchdowns":0.0,"targets":8.0,"receptions":6.0,"receiving_yards":61.0,"receiving_touchdowns":1.0,"fumbles_lost":0.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"d